# 媒体文件不推送到 GitHub，统一上传至腾讯云存储桶后，在 HTML 中改用腾讯云链接
# Media files: images, video, audio - upload to Tencent Cloud COS, then update HTML links

# 图片
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.svg
*.ico

# 视频
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.flv
*.wmv

# 音频
*.mp3
*.wav
*.ogg
*.m4a
*.aac
*.flac

# 腾讯云 COS 密钥配置（绝对不能推到 GitHub）
.cos-config.json

# Node 依赖
node_modules/

# 不规则动词 PDF 例句生成断点缓存
irregular_verbs/scripts/.pdf-examples-progress.json

# HET cloze vocab regen tooling (local cache)
HET/词形填空练习/courseware/.regen-cloze-vocab-progress.json
HET/词形填空练习/courseware/.regen-cloze-vocab-cache/
HET/词形填空练习/courseware/.expand-cloze-derivs-progress.json
HET/词形填空练习/courseware/.expand-cloze-derivs-cache/

